WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.437
I'm doing well tonight and
I hope you're doing the same

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.673 size:88% position:44%
Let's get to the news.
While preparing to board

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.142
Air Force One yesterday
on his first foreign trip

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:12.278 size:84% position:42%
since taking office,
President Biden was hit

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.613 line:92%
in the neck by a flying cicada

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:17.317
And get this, Biden still thinks
they can find common ground.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Come on man,
let's work together."

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden addressed
group of U.S. Troops

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
serving abroad in the U.K.
yesterday

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
and promised that he wouldn'
hold back in his meeting

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.129
next week with Russian President
Vladimir Putin.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
So look out, Vladimir,
you're about to get called

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Buster Brown.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.370
Before leaving yesterday for
the U.K., President Biden said

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.306
that the trip is all about
strengthening the alliance

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Europe.
That's never a good sign.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.911
Any time a couple goes on a trip
to strengthen their alliance

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:48.048
you know they're about two weeks
away from a divorce.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden me
today

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.919
with British Prime Ministe
Boris Johnson's wife, Carrie

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:53.920 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
over tea. Oh, man.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.856
It's like those moms in the park
who only hang out

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.058 line:92%
'cause their kids are friends.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.659 line:92%
"Oh, Joe -- Joe fell down.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
Joe, get up, you're fine,
honey."

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ British Accent ] "Boris.
Boris, what did you just put i

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
your mouth?
Spit it out, Boris."

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normally ] After
President Biden this week

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:10.537
told her he would end thei
infrastructure negotiations,

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
Republican Senator
Shelley Moore Capito

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.240 line:92%
said in an interview yesterday

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she was disappointed in
Biden's decision.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said progressives,
"Disappointed in Biden?

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.413 line:92%
Finally some common ground."

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:24.984
Vice President Kamala Harris
invited every female Senator

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
to a dinner next week at her
residence,

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:32.158
while Kyrsten Sinema invited
them to...adult Quidditch?

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:36.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
And a midnight screening o
"Rocky Horror"?

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
France is reportedly sending
the U.S.

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:41.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
a replica statue of --
a replica Statue of Liberty,

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.570 size:75% position:38%
excuse me, nicknamed
"The Little Sister,"

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:47.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it'll be the only foreigne
we let in this year.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
The final episode of
the reality show

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Keeping Up With the
Kardashians" aired tonight

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, if you've never seen
the show before,

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.315 line:92%
trust me, you've kept up.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:57.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're sisters
and they're rich.

00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:58.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Got it.

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.386
My wife loves that show.
I've never seen an episode

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:04.958
I only hear it while she's
watching on it her phone,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I feel like I've heard thi
a hundred times.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:13.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Crying ] "It is just reall
hard having sisters."

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:16.769
[ Normally ] And finally, Mattel
announced today

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it will launch a new
line of Barbies

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are made from
recycled plastic

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.475 line:92%
called Barbie Loves the Ocean.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Which a great idea.

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just wish they'd recycled it
a little bit more.

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was the monologue
everybody.

